 ' | ' + row.getCell(19).value + ' | ' + row.getCell(20).value);\n    }\n  });\n}\ncheckCategories().catch(console.error);\n\"","Cwd":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\worktrees\\resilient-bardeen\\add_goejeong_manhwa_data","WaitMsBeforeAsync":5000,"toolAction":"Check similar industries in completed DB","toolSummary":"Inspect industry classifications"}}]}
